---
import StaticPage from '../layouts/StaticPage.astro';

const lastUpdated = 'September 19, 2026';
---

<StaticPage
	title="Disclosure & Disclaimers"
	description="ShiftBackspace's affiliate disclosure, including our Amazon Associates disclosure, plus our technical, editorial, and external-links disclaimers."
	icon="💰"
>
	<p class="updated" style="margin-top:-1rem;">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

	<h2>Amazon Associates disclosure</h2>
	<p>
		ShiftBackspace is a participant in the Amazon Services LLC Associates Program, an affiliate
		advertising program designed to provide a means for sites to earn advertising fees by advertising
		and linking to Amazon.com and affiliated sites.
	</p>
	<div class="note-box">
		<span class="note-icon">💵</span>
		<span>
			<strong>As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases.</strong> This means that if
			you click a link to Amazon from this Site and make a purchase, we may receive a small
			commission — at no additional cost to you. Prices and availability are accurate as of the date
			of publication and are subject to change.
		</span>
	</div>

	<h2>Other affiliate relationships</h2>
	<p>
		In addition to Amazon, we may occasionally participate in other affiliate programs or accept
		review units, loaner devices, or software licenses from manufacturers. Whenever we do, we'll
		clearly identify the relationship on the relevant page. Our participation in an affiliate program
		never determines whether we recommend a product — see "Editorial independence" below.
	</p>

	<h2>Advertising disclosure</h2>
	<p>
		We may display advertisements on this Site through third-party advertising networks. These
		networks may use cookies and similar technologies to serve ads based on your visits to this and other websites. See our <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> for more on how cookies are used.
	</p>

	<h2>Editorial independence</h2>
	<p>
		Our recommendations are based on research, publicly available information, and — wherever
		possible — hands-on testing, with every device used for at least two weeks in real daily use
		before we review it. Affiliate commissions and review units do not influence which products we
		choose to recommend or how we rate them. If we don't think a product is good, we won't recommend
		it, commission or not.
	</p>

	<h2>Technical &amp; troubleshooting disclaimer</h2>
	<div class="note-box warm">
		<span class="note-icon">🛠️</span>
		<span>
			The content on ShiftBackspace — including articles about troubleshooting Microsoft products,
			software tutorials, smart home setup, and network configuration — is provided for general
			informational and educational purposes only. It is <strong>not</strong> a substitute for
			official manufacturer support, a warranty service, or a qualified IT professional for
			business-critical or sensitive systems. Always back up important data before making changes to
			a device or system, and proceed at your own risk. We're not responsible for data loss, device
			damage, or downtime resulting from steps described on this Site.
		</span>
	</div>

	<h2>Accuracy of information</h2>
	<p>
		We make a good-faith effort to keep articles accurate and up to date, but software updates,
		product availability, and settings menus change frequently. We don't guarantee that every piece
		of information on the Site is complete, current, or error-free, and we're not liable for actions taken based on Site content. If you spot something outdated or incorrect, please <a href="/contact/">let us know</a>.
	</p>

	<h2>External links</h2>
	<p>
		This Site may link to third-party websites, including retailers, manufacturers, official support
		pages, and other informational resources. We don't control these sites and aren't responsible for
		their content, accuracy, or privacy practices.
	</p>

	<h2>Questions</h2>
	<p>
		If you have questions about any of the disclosures on this page, email us at <a href="mailto:dorseyhollifield@gmail.com">dorseyhollifield@gmail.com</a>.
	</p>
</StaticPage>
